        {
          "id": 1232340334,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I think it might make sense to just remove RIPEMD160 hashes from capinfos. OpenSSL and Go crypto have deprecated it as well, so it might be more trouble than it's worth at this point.\n\nIt might make sense to disable FIPS mode as well.",
