    {
      "diff": "@@ -200,7 +200,7 @@ Prints the help listing and exits.\n -H::\n +\n --\n-Displays the SHA256, RIPEMD160, and SHA1 hashes for the file.\n+Displays the SHA256 and SHA1 hashes for the file.\n SHA1 output may be removed in the future.\n --\n \n",
